  <Prose
    title="About"
    standfirst="Eleven One Research is an independent research and analysis practice. It sells decision-grade written analysis rather than hours."
  >
    <h2>Who this is for</h2>
    <p>Private equity professionals, corporate strategy teams and management consultants working on a decision that is hard to reverse: an acquisition, a market entry, a competitive response, a board question with a date on it.</p>
    <p>People who read working documents for a living and can tell the difference between rigour and the appearance of it. That audience is the reason the apparatus is on the page rather than in an endnote.</p>

    <h2>What makes the work different</h2>
    <p>The analysis is produced by someone who has held operating and PE-backed roles rather than only modelled them: Alvarez &amp; Marsal, Mirion Technologies, The Keystone Group, and VP Strategy at StatLab Medical Products.</p>
    <p>That is the one difference a research vendor cannot truthfully copy. The work is written by an operator who has had to live with this class of decision.</p>

    <h2>How the practice runs</h2>
    <p>Published work is the proof and engagements are the product. Briefs are published to demonstrate method and judgment, and they are free to read in full, because a demonstration you have to pay for is not a demonstration.</p>
    <p>The practice is deliberately low-touch. You should be able to read a brief, judge the thinking, and decide, without a call and without joining anything.</p>

    <h2>Getting in touch</h2>
    <p>Write to <a href="mailto:john@nolandadvisory.com">john@nolandadvisory.com</a>.</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
